{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 56,
  "name": "火山旅",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07763",
              "text": "旅：小亨，旅贞吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07763",
                "bodyParagraph": 7699
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07764",
              "text": "【白话】《旅卦》象征旅行：小心谦顺可以亨通，旅行虽是小事，但能坚守正道必然吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07764",
                "bodyParagraph": 7700
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07765",
              "text": "《象》曰：山上有火，旅；君子以明慎用刑，而不留狱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07765",
                "bodyParagraph": 7701
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07766",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《旅卦》的卦象是艮（山）下离（火）上，为火势匆匆蔓延之表象，象征行旅之人匆匆赶路；君子观此应谨慎使用刑罚，明断决狱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07766",
                "bodyParagraph": 7702
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07768",
              "text": "旅卦离上艮下，山上有火，火势不断迁移，比喻人在外旅行或异乡客居的无常。卦辞“旅，小亨，旅贞吉”，告诫客居者守正、小事可成，大事不宜妄求。《象》曰“君子以明慎用刑，而不留狱”，重视明察而不拖延。出行、创业、经营中都应尊重当地人，谨慎处事，既保留自立能力，也避免傲慢和过度依赖。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07768",
                "bodyParagraph": 7704
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07771",
              "text": "初六，旅琐琐，斯其所取灾。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07771",
                "bodyParagraph": 7707
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07772",
              "text": "【白话】初六，旅行之始猥琐不堪，这是自己招来的灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07772",
                "bodyParagraph": 7708
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07773",
              "text": "《象》曰：“旅琐琐”，志穷灾也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07773",
                "bodyParagraph": 7709
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07774",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“旅行之始猥琐不堪”，是意志穷迫造成的灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07774",
                "bodyParagraph": 7710
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07776",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07776",
                "bodyParagraph": 7712
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07778",
              "text": "初六爻动，变为第30卦《离卦》（离为火）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07778",
                "bodyParagraph": 7714
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07780",
              "text": "初六“旅琐琐，斯其所取灾”，旅行中斤斤计较、犹疑失措，容易自己招惹祸患；应先定原则与方向。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07780",
                "bodyParagraph": 7716
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07783",
              "text": "六二，旅即次，怀其资，得童仆，贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07783",
                "bodyParagraph": 7719
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07784",
              "text": "【白话】六二，旅客住在旅舍，携带钱财，有童仆照顾，能坚守正道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07784",
                "bodyParagraph": 7720
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07785",
              "text": "《象》曰：“得童仆贞”，终无尤也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07785",
                "bodyParagraph": 7721
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07786",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“有童仆照顾，能坚守正道”，故不会有过失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07786",
                "bodyParagraph": 7722
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07788",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07788",
                "bodyParagraph": 7724
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07790",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第50卦《鼎卦》（火风鼎）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07790",
                "bodyParagraph": 7726
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07792",
              "text": "六二“旅即次，怀其资，得童仆，贞”，投宿得安、随身有资财又有协助，安身条件较好，但仍须守正。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07792",
                "bodyParagraph": 7728
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07795",
              "text": "九三，旅焚其次，丧其童仆；贞厉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07795",
                "bodyParagraph": 7731
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07796",
              "text": "【白话】九三，旅途中施舍失火，从而丧失了照顾自己的童仆，失去正道，会出现危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07796",
                "bodyParagraph": 7732
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07797",
              "text": "《象》曰：“旅焚其次”，亦以伤矣；以旅与下，其义丧也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07797",
                "bodyParagraph": 7733
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07798",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“旅途中施舍失火”，已经受到损伤；把童仆视为路人，童仆舍其而去，是必然的，合乎道理的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07798",
                "bodyParagraph": 7734
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07800",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07800",
                "bodyParagraph": 7736
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07802",
              "text": "九三爻动，变为第35卦《晋卦》（火地晋）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07802",
                "bodyParagraph": 7738
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07804",
              "text": "九三“旅焚其次，丧其童仆，贞厉”，客店遭火而仆从离去，提示客居之人应谦恭待下，不可骄横致失援。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07804",
                "bodyParagraph": 7740
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07807",
              "text": "九四，旅于处，得其资斧，我心不快。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07807",
                "bodyParagraph": 7743
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07808",
              "text": "【白话】九四，身处异乡暂为栖身，不能安居，虽然得到路费，但我的心情仍然不愉快。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07808",
                "bodyParagraph": 7744
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07809",
              "text": "《象》曰：“旅于处”，未得位也；“得其资斧”，心未快也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07809",
                "bodyParagraph": 7745
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07810",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“身处异乡暂为栖身，不能安居”，因为毕竟未得到长久安身的地方；“虽然得到路费”，但仍然客居他乡，故此时心中仍不畅快。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07810",
                "bodyParagraph": 7746
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07812",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07812",
                "bodyParagraph": 7748
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07814",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第52卦《艮卦》（艮为山）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07814",
                "bodyParagraph": 7750
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07816",
              "text": "九四“旅于处，得其资斧，我心不快”，虽得住处、财富与工具，仍因异乡无根而不满足；物质安全不等于内心安定。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07816",
                "bodyParagraph": 7752
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07819",
              "text": "六五，射雉，一矢亡；终以誉命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07819",
                "bodyParagraph": 7755
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07820",
              "text": "【白话】六五，射野鸡，丧失一枝箭；但最终获得荣誉和爵命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07820",
                "bodyParagraph": 7756
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07821",
              "text": "《象》曰：“终以誉命”，上逮也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07821",
                "bodyParagraph": 7757
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07822",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“最终获得荣誉和爵命”，是由于能亲近居高位的尊者。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07822",
                "bodyParagraph": 7758
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07824",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07824",
                "bodyParagraph": 7760
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07826",
              "text": "六五爻动，变为第33卦《遁卦》（天山遁）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07826",
                "bodyParagraph": 7762
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07828",
              "text": "六五“射雉，一矢亡，终以誉命”，以一箭得雉象征把握机会展露才干，虽有投入，最终赢得声誉与任命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07828",
                "bodyParagraph": 7764
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07831",
              "text": "上九，鸟焚其巢，旅人先笑，后号咷；丧牛于易，凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07831",
                "bodyParagraph": 7767
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07832",
              "text": "【白话】上九，鸟巢失火被烧掉，行旅之人得高位先喜悦欢笑，后因遭祸事而号啕痛哭；牧人在牧场丢失了牛，有凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07832",
                "bodyParagraph": 7768
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07833",
              "text": "《象》曰：以旅在上，其义焚也；丧牛于易，终莫之闻也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07833",
                "bodyParagraph": 7769
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07834",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“作为旅客却在异乡身居高位，这样必然要遭到焚巢之灾；牧人在牧场丢失了牛，这个可悲的结局是无可挽回的。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07834",
                "bodyParagraph": 7770
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07836",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07836",
                "bodyParagraph": 7772
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07838",
              "text": "上九爻动，变为第62卦《小过卦》（雷山小过）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07838",
                "bodyParagraph": 7774
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07840",
              "text": "上九“鸟焚其巢，旅人先笑后号啕；丧牛于易，凶”，乐极生悲，根基被毁，提醒人在旅途中勿因一时得势而骄狂。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07840",
                "bodyParagraph": 7776
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
